                                <h3>Event Detail</h3>
                                <p>On June 27, 2024, Skillbook Skill Development Centre visited Lala Hansraj Gupta ITI Narela to conduct an inspiring session on career guidance and skill development. The team aimed to equip students with insights into building their futures and understanding how essential skills can significantly enhance their career prospects.
                                    During the session, Skillbook’s experts shared valuable tips on how students can identify and develop key skills to boost their career paths. Students actively participated, engaging with the guidance provided and asking questions to better understand their own goals. By the end of the event, students expressed their gratitude with smiles and a big thanks to the Skillbook team for their support and insights.
                                    </p>
